  DEMO READY — Fully Reactive IRS Grid via USD OIS Market Data
  Web UI:  http://localhost:10000

  Published tables (open in DH web IDE):
    swap_quote_live         — USD OIS par rates (from market data server)
    integrated_rate_point_live — integrated curve knots (average short rate R_i)
    interest_rate_swap_live — IRS pricing: NPV, DV01 (@computed, full scheduler)
    swap_summary            — aggregate NPV + DV01 (ticking summary)
    swap_risk_ladder        — portfolio risk ladder: ∂Portfolio / ∂Quote
    yield_curve_live        — IntegratedShortRateCurve (C² smooth, EXP DF)

  Reactive chain (all from one batch_update):
    OIS rate → @computed curve rate → @computed float_rate
    → @computed npv → @computed total_npv
    Every @effect fires automatically: DH push

  Press Ctrl+C to stop.
